# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
#
# Controller input for Killzone (SCES-52004), from power-on: what a player
# presses to get from the first screens into the game, as a script for
# ps2n-host -pad (scripts/windows/game.ps1 -Pad). The frame numbers are those
# of a run with no memory card in either slot.
#
# This file holds button presses, written for PS2Native's tests. Nothing in
# it comes from the game.
#
# frame  input  frames held

# "No memory card (PS2) found ... Do you want to start the game?": Continue.
1900    cross   4
